title: "Bimanual wall-climbing robot"
abstract: "Code, robot model, benchmark, reference climbs and evaluation scripts of the paper Learning Versatile Bimanual Wall-Rung Climbing from Hardware-Available Sensing with Search-Seeded Reverse Curricula: a 24.5 kg two-armed robot that hangs from wall rungs by hooked hands, in MuJoCo, and one PPO policy that learns seven climbing skills with it."
